  sopSections:
  - title: Objective
    body: Select equipment from either case, carry one item at a time, and install
      it only in valid rack U positions.
  - title: Rack Rules
    body: U1 and U2 are blocked. U40 is reserved for the existing patch panel. Two-U
      equipment must start at U3 through U38.
  - title: Workflow
    body: Start with power equipment, then network devices, then servers. The guide
      is reference-only and does not grade the result.
